{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Above is a small rooftop-building game about finding peace in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own elevated retreat, high above the city's noise. Turn an empty rooftop into a dreamy getaway - whether it\u2019s a sunlit Mediterranean courtyard, a sleek modern terrace, a colorful Cuban hideout, or a cozy post-apocalyptic hideaway. And as you build and decorate,\u00a0 watch as life unfolds - day turns into night, a stray cat strolls in the sun, and birds land for a quick bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No timers. No stress. Just your own quiet corner in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535760/extras/HighAbove_gif.gif?t=1742507060\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hi! High Above is a small project made by one person - me, Alex. Please share your thoughts here on Steam or join my Discord so that we can build High Above together.\u00a0</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535760?t=1742507060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535760?t=1742507060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535760/e5ff99168e742a1cb8cd9c815283639afdb0b442/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742507060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535760/e5ff99168e742a1cb8cd9c815283639afdb0b442/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742507060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Above is a small rooftop-building game about finding peace in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own elevated retreat, high above the city's noise. Turn an empty rooftop into a dreamy getaway - whether it\u2019s a sunlit Mediterranean courtyard, a sleek modern terrace, a colorful Cuban hideout, or a cozy post-apocalyptic hideaway. And as you build and decorate,\u00a0 watch as life unfolds - day turns into night, a stray cat strolls in the sun, and birds land for a quick bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No timers. No stress. Just your own quiet corner in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535760/extras/HighAbove_gif.gif?t=1742507060\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hi! High Above is a small project made by one person - me, Alex. Please share your thoughts here on Steam or join my Discord so that we can build High Above together.\u00a0</i></p>","developers":["DVision Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535760/4b3cf47445fab40796a0fa93a83e3992fbed48a9/header.jpg?t=1742507060","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109902,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109902/movie480.mp4?t=1742507058","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai